  "bodyHtml": "\n\t\n\t<div class=\"col-md-8\">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"epta-image-area\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-title-date no-image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Guild of Harwich Artists Monthly General Meeting</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tecset-date\"><span class=\"tribe-event-date-start\">September 23, 2023 @ 2:00 pm</span> - <span class=\"tribe-event-time\">4:45 pm</span></div>\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-light-bg\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"epta-content-area\">\n\t\t   \t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-single-event-description tribe-events-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>The September General Meeting will be held <strong>Saturday, September 23rd in the Multi-Purpose Room of the Harwich Community Center.</strong>  Our demonstration artist is <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6600\" src=\"/media/archive/336818c4ed0e821c7ccebe3db63fc32c871ac59adffd02a8141024925587750b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6601\" src=\"/media/archive/112c2c743c644aec872a660ae8be8d816cfbf952a5c3b9adb142aa030e63b38b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\" /> doing pastels.  The meeting and free demonstration are open to the public.</p>\n\n\n\t\t\t </div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-map-area\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"tribe-events-venue-map\">\n\t\n<p data-fidelity-note=\"embed\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed/v1/place?key=AIzaSyDNsicAsP6-VuGtAb1O9riI3oc_NOb7IOU&amp;q=100+Oak+Street+Harwich+MA+02645+United+States+&amp;zoom=10\">Google maps iframe displaying the address to Harwich Community Center</a></p>\n</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\n\t<div class=\"col-md-4\">\n\t\t<div class=\"epta-sidebar-area\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-sidebar-box\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-past-event-notice\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-notices\"><ul><li>This event has passed.</li></ul></div>\